.TH TEATHER-GTK 1 "August 2026" "Teather 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
teather-gtk \- graphical Teather Linux USB desktop client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B teather-gtk
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B teather-gtk
opens the focused GTK 3 interface for device approval and selection, connection
state, counters, diagnostics, auto-connect, and remembered-device management.
When Ayatana AppIndicator is available it also provides a tray menu. The main
window remains functional without tray integration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR teather (1),
.BR teatherd (1)
